2. EXHAUSTION FILTER (regime-aware): This system trades ONE setup - a 4h volatility-compression breakout. In that regime a close beyond the 20-bar extreme with expanding volume is the signal itself, so bollinger_bands.condition "ABOVE_UPPER_BAND" on a LONG (or "BELOW_LOWER_BAND" on a SHORT) is EXPANSION CONFIRMATION, not exhaustion - do NOT veto for it alone. Veto and output "HOLD" only when momentum is genuinely stretched: rsi_condition is "OVERBOUGHT_DANGER" (>=78) on a LONG or "OVERSOLD_DANGER" (<=22) on a SHORT, or price is already more than 1.5x ATR beyond the broken level (chasing an extended move).
